# Tienda de Ciudad Marea (C2, contract 31, interior, Mart): the shopkeeper behind the counter; the shop opens at once: `shop ciudad_marea`
# (assets/data/shops.toml shop 3: Cristal, Cristal Plus, Pocion, Superpocion, Antidoto, Despertar, Antiparalizador, Antiquemar, Repelente, Luz de salida). Same layout as the Cantera tienda. column = i, row = j.
@map tienda_marea
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  K  object=counter
  E  object=shelf
  V  npc=tendero id=clerk face=SW script=clerk
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwywwwyww
  |.EEE.EE.
  |...V....
  |.KKK....
  |.......E
  |........
  |...mm...
@warp m -> ciudad_marea spawn=tienda_door
@script clerk npc
    shop ciudad_marea
@end
